  "[says] Wang Lung speaks of his sons' wealth and freedom.",
  "[action] eldest son wears fine silks",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung):[GE-OMITTED:1ed4dd40c4b5]",
  "[action] The eldest son prefers a simple meal like his father.",
  "[action] (to the second son) Wang Lung observes his second son's growing wealth.",
