  "[action] (to the eldest son) The eldest son laughs back at his father.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung tells his eldest son to eat and drink.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Eat and drink, my heart, and be merry, for here is a great day in your house and a day in mine.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"And you, my heart, you who have this great shop of yours, you have had no great eating or drinking these days, have you?\"",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the second son) Wang Lung looks at his second son with concern.",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits on the grass and observes his sons.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"You have had a great eating and drinking, my son, for you have bought a great house and a great wife and have eaten at your table every day and have drunk at your table every day.\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"But my son, you have not had a day like this and a day like this is a day in your house and a day in mine.\"",
