  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung looks at his eldest son.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"But, my father, a man has no life without his children, and I have a life and you have a life and we have a life and our children have a life and we are not so poor and our house is not so poor and we have many children.\"",
